Package: stamp-usb
Architecture: all
Depends: quickshell, polkit, file, zenity, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: udisks2, sound-theme-freedesktop, gnome-session-canberra | libcanberra-gtk3
Description: Write disk images to USB sticks
 Stamp is a Quickshell window for writing an ISO or IMG file to a USB stick.
 It lists only USB disks, refuses the disk that holds the running system, and
 asks for permission through polkit before it writes.
